    "detailed_description": "Alive in Dinerland is a gripping garden game. Alice dropped through the rabbit hole, but in the end, she found herself in the role of a small diner owner. Now she needs to plant and grow some food to feed cute rabbits from the Dinerland. In this cozy building game, you will: <br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build your own diner.<br><br></li><li>Plant a lot of different foods like tomatoes, pumpkins, carrots and more.<br><br></li><li>Travel through the Dinerland world, going between procedurally generated locations.<br><br></li><li>Fight characters from the original novel.<br><br></li><li>Craft weapons, hats, and glasses.<br><br></li><li>Meet some friends and foes.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Alive in Dinerland is a gripping garden game. Alice dropped through the rabbit hole, but in the end, she found herself in the role of a small diner owner. Now she needs to plant and grow some food to feed cute rabbits from the Dinerland. In this cozy building game, you will: <br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build your own diner.<br><br></li><li>Plant a lot of different foods like tomatoes, pumpkins, carrots and more.<br><br></li><li>Travel through the Dinerland world, going between procedurally generated locations.<br><br></li><li>Fight characters from the original novel.<br><br></li><li>Craft weapons, hats, and glasses.<br><br></li><li>Meet some friends and foes.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a whimsical and treacherous journey through a twisted version of Wonderland in &quot;Alive in Dinerland,&quot; a gripping survival game inspired by the beloved tale of Alice in Wonderland.",
